<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Modified Superglide macro</Major>
    <Description>This macro it's a little bit upgraded version of my last glide macro

Bind in game setting C as Crouch (while holding)
Enable auto-spring 

working good on 1920x1080 Resolution 

Explanation:
When jumping onto an obstacle, click the C button when the screen shakes. I suggest practicing this macro at the shooting range. </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 2 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyUp 44 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>